~ topic #[不怎么 "bu4 zen3me"]

examples

example #1[他 tā] #2[$topic] #3[喜欢 xǐhuan] #4[说话 shuōhuà] 。
trl *1[He] *2[doesn't] *3[like] *4[talking] *2[too much].

example #1[我 wǒ] #2[老公 lǎogōng] #3[$topic] #4[做饭 "zuò fàn"] 。
trl *1[My] *2[husband] *3[doesn't] *4[cook] *3[very often].

end examples

p When followed by an adj., it means the same thing as #[不太 "bu4 tai4"].

examples

example #1[我 wǒ] #2[觉得 juédé] #3[这个 "zhè ge"] #4[菜 cài] #5[$topic] #6[好吃 hǎochī] 。
trl *1[I] *5[don't] *2[find] *3[this] *4[food] *5[very] *6[tasty].

end examples